## Why This Is Asked

Assesses practical cost-monitoring setup using Billing export, BigQuery, and simple alerting. Tests ability to connect services, implement a threshold, and ensure safe permissions.

## Key Concepts

- Billing export to BigQuery
- Cloud Scheduler and Cloud Function
- Simple baseline computation (7-day) in SQL
- Slack webhook integration
- Idempotent alert writes (insertId)
- Least-privilege IAM

